THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

Loaded by the browser at runtime, not vendored into this repository:

  Leaflet 1.9.4                      BSD-2-Clause
  https://leafletjs.com/             (unpkg CDN, subresource-integrity pinned)

  Cloudflare Turnstile               Cloudflare Terms of Service
  https://challenges.cloudflare.com/ (loaded only when a sitekey is configured)

Server-side only, installed from npm against a lockfile — never sent to a
browser:

  @supabase/supabase-js              MIT
  https://github.com/supabase/supabase-js

  supabase (CLI, devDependency)      MIT
  https://github.com/supabase/cli

  The browser talks to PostgREST over plain fetch instead of loading a client
  library from a CDN. A bare ES `import` cannot carry a subresource-integrity
  hash, so a CDN-hosted library would be the one unverifiable script on a page
  that renders user-submitted forms.

Map data:

  © OpenStreetMap contributors       Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

  Basemap tiles                      CARTO (Positron / Dark Matter)
  https://carto.com/attributions     built from OpenStreetMap data

  Tiles come from CARTO's basemap CDN, not from tile.openstreetmap.org. The OSMF
  tile servers are donation-funded and their usage policy asks production
  applications not to use them; this project used them during development and
  moved off before launch.

  The underlying DATA is still OpenStreetMap, so the ODbL attribution obligation
  travels with it regardless of who serves the images. Both credits are rendered
  in the map's attribution control on every map, including the small location
  picker in the add-truck form, and must not be removed.

Public data:

  Ohio mobile food service license records, obtained by public records request
  from county health districts. Public records; not copyrightable as facts.
  See docs/FINDINGS.md for provenance and the reasoning behind what this project
  will and will not ingest.
